~ start

if Utils.firsttime == true
	set Utils.firsttime = false
	Trunk: [[Hello!!!]]
	- Um hello... what are you?
		Trunk: Nini!!!
		- But what exactly are you??
		Nini: Nini?
		- Okay Nini, nice to meet you. Could you possibly let me use the lift?
		Nini: No.
		- Why?
		Nini: I only give u the lift if I get something in return.
		- Okay, what do you want?
		Nini: Participate in my quizz.
		Nini: Im a big "Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?" fan but no one wants to play it.
		- Okay, let's play.
			=> quiz
		- Will play later.. See you Nini.
		
		=> END
else if Utils.quizzpassed == false and Utils.firstime == false
	Nini:[[Hey | Aloha | Hi again]]. Are you ready for the quizz now?
	- Yes, let's play. => quiz
	- Not yet Nini. => END
else if Utils.quizzpassed == true
	set Utils.quizzpassed == false
	Nini: Did you bring me moreeee coins?
	- Yes. Here they are.
		if Utils.knjige >= 5
			set Utils.ninigotov = true
			set Utils.knjige = 0
			Nini: Okay friend. Thank you for coins. I will let you pass through the lift but be careful. Nini is much kinder than others.
			- Thank you Nini. See you soon.
			=> END
		else
			Nini: liar liar pants on fire.
			- Ahh.
			=> END
	- Nope
		Nini: Go get them please.
	=> END 
else 
	Nini: Im too tired to talk now. We will talk later.... 
=> END


~ quiz
Host Nini: [speed=0.5] Firrst question... for uhhh [wait=1] [speed=0.5]1000 coins is: "Based on data collected in 2022. the population of Slovenia is: [wait = 1.2] \n A. 1 million  [wait = 1.2]\n B. 2 millions [wait = 1.2] \n C. 3 millions  or [wait = 1.2] \n D. 4 millions"
- A.
	Host Nini: [[Come back when you are read. This is a real quizz! | Tough luck... See ya | You failed! Go... prepare better]]
	=> END
- B.
	Host Nini: [[Bravissimo! | Well done]]. Let's go to the question number 2.
	Host Nini: [speed=0.5] The second question for 2000 coins is: "Which one of these does not accept studentski boni: [wait = 1.2]\n A. McDonalds Koper [wait = 1.2] \n B. SUBWAY [wait = 1.2]\n C. Pekarna Europa [wait = 1.2] \n D. Magic Fast Food"
	- A. 
		Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.	
	- B. 
		Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.	
	- C.
		Host Nini: Well played. Let's go to the last question.
		Host Nini: The question number three is: "To successfully enroll into the next year, a student must have a minimum number of ECSTs which is:  [wait = 1.2]\n A. 36 [wait = 1.2] \n B. 42 [wait = 1.2]\n C. 48 [wait = 1.2] \n D. 54"
		- A.
			Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.
			- Can't I call someone for help?
			Host Nini: In Nini millionaire quizz there are no second chances. Go prepare better. => END
		- B.
			set Utils.quizzpassed = true
			Host Nini: Well played! You passed my quizz.
			- Can I use lift now?
			Host Nini: Not yet. Bring me 5 coins and I shall let you go.
			- Ahh okay.
			- Yes Nini...
		- C.
			Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.
			- Can't I call someone for help?
			Host Nini: In Nini millionaire quizz there are no second chances. Go prepare better. => END
		- D.
			Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.
			- Can't I call someone for help?
			Host Nini: In Nini millionaire quizz there are no second chances. Go prepare better. => END
	- D.
		Host Nini: You are out! Come back prepared.	
- C.
	Host Nini: [[Come back when you are read. This is a real quizz! | Tough luck... See ya | You failed! Go... prepare better]]
	=> END
- D.
	Host Nini: [[Come back when you are read. This is a real quizz! | Tough luck... See ya | You failed! Go... prepare better]]
	=> END